cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ce_fields: simulated and reconstructed Common Era climate fields"
abstract: >-
  Utilities to load, stitch and bias-correct PMIP4 past1000/past2k and
  CMIP6 historical simulations, and to load the Last Millennium Reanalysis
  (v2.1, Online, Seasonal) and the Neukom et al. (2019) field
  reconstructions, so that several validation projects can share them.
type: software
